# Functions excused from a clause of tests/check-session-end.sh, one line each:
#
#   Cn|file|function|reason|revisit
#
# The clause C5 (a request is registered after a good send) has no excuse
# and reads no line.  The clauses that do (the whole-table ends and the
# writers of a child's input) land with the pass that moves their callers
# onto the owner, and each line there fails as stale once its function no
# longer needs it.  Until then a line in this file is refused.
